{"data":{"markdown":{"html":"<p>The Pain &#x26; Neurorecovery Group is part of the University Clinic for Neurorehabilitation at Aarhus University and is based at Hammel Neurocenter, a highly specialized national center for neurorehabilitation after acquired brain injury.\nThe group brings together experimental, translational, and clinical expertise across multiple disciplines. It also operates the <strong>Hammel Pain Physiology Lab</strong>, an embedded hospital-based facility that gives participants convenient access to experimental studies and clinical trials.</p>","frontmatter":{"image":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/ab7bb/Logo.jpg","srcSet":"/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/7177f/Logo.jpg 88w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/70376/Logo.jpg 175w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/ab7bb/Logo.jpg 350w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/1aaea/Logo.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 350px) 350px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/e6012/Logo.webp 88w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/31e99/Logo.webp 175w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/de0a7/Logo.webp 350w,\n/static/1e33e33f685b5eb885a1eb34d5bfeac0/43f18/Logo.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 350px) 350px, 100vw"}]},"width":350,"height":233}}},"title":"About us"}}}}